== Third-party code included (modified) ==

This project contains code derived from OTA Pulse
(https://github.com/RemuruSama/OTA-Pulse), licensed under the Apache License 2.0
(Copyright 2026 OTA Pulse; the upstream repository ships no NOTICE file):
  - src/opkv/ota_query.py  (from Request.kt, Crypto.kt, Data.kt, RegionData.kt)
  - src/opkv/resolver.py   (from OtaResolver.kt)
The derived files were translated from Kotlin to Python and modified; each carries
a notice to that effect in its header. The two HTTP header values in HEADERS
(src/opkv/rangehttp.py) are taken from OtaResolver.kt as well.

The payload.bin (CrAU) format and protobuf field numbers follow AOSP's update_metadata.proto
(Apache License 2.0, The Android Open Source Project). No AOSP source code is copied.

== Third-party services and data (no code included) ==

No source code of the following projects is copied or redistributed. They are queried at
runtime and only the factual metadata listed below is stored in data/results.*.
Some of them publish no license; this project is not affiliated with any of them.
  - OTA Pulse devices/oneplus.json (model list): downloaded at runtime, not redistributed.
  - roms.danielspringer.at (release catalog API): release names/versions/regions.
  - Oxygen Updater API (https://oxygenupdater.com): release version, md5, size.
  - spike0en/oneplus_archive (https://github.com/spike0en/oneplus_archive): the boot.7z
    release assets are downloaded temporarily to read the kernel version string and are
    not redistributed.
  - Bartixxx32/OnePlus-antirollchecker database.json: md5 checksums.

Firmware is the property of OnePlus / OPPO; no firmware image is stored or redistributed
here, only the "Linux version ..." string extracted from boot.img.
